<title>ESTONIA: UHISLIISING TO ISSUE 30 MILLION KROONS IN CPS.</title>
<headline>UHISLIISING TO ISSUE 30 MILLION KROONS IN CPS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uhisliising, the leasing subsidiary of Uhispank, will issue 30 million kroons in commercial papers on June 12, the bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>The yield for the three-month commercial papers is 7.95 percent, Andres Ajamaa of Uhispank's capital markets told Reuters.</p>
<p>It is the third issue of its one-year commercial paper programme, he added.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
